2. Files derived from the Fast3D renderer (n64-fast3d-engine)

platform/zune_render.cpp is a port of sm64ex's src/pc/gfx/gfx_opengl.c, and patches 0008 and
0010 to 0013 in patches/ change src/pc/gfx/gfx_pc.c. Both files are the Fast3D renderer, whose
terms apply to these derived files. Note condition 2: a built game contains the ROM's assets,
so it may not be redistributed.

