4. sm64ex

sm64ex/ is a git submodule: a pointer to https://github.com/sm64pc/sm64ex, not a copy of it.
The other patches in patches/ quote lines of sm64ex as context, and platform/zune_main.cpp
and platform/zune_config.c restate parts of its src/pc glue (pc_main.c, platform.c,
configfile.c). What they hold of sm64ex stays under whatever terms cover sm64ex.


What a build downloads (Microsoft's compiler, the OpenZDK SDK, NVIDIA's shader compiler,
zune-deploy and the Khronos headers; see README.md) is not part of this repository and
comes under its owners' terms.
